sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant PC as PaymentHistory Component
    participant RQ as React Query
    participant API as Lightning API
    participant BE as Backend Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant CB as Clipboard

    User->>PC: Views Dashboard
    PC->>RQ: Initialize query
    RQ->>API: getUserPaymentHistory()
    API->>BE: GET /api/lightning/user/payments
    BE->>DB: Query user payments
    DB-->>BE: Return payment records
    BE-->>API: Payment data (JSON)
    API-->>RQ: LightningPayment[]
    RQ-->>PC: Update state
    PC-->>User: Display payments

    Note over PC: User applies filter
    User->>PC: Click "Paid" filter
    PC->>PC: Filter local data
    PC-->>User: Show filtered results

    Note over PC: User sorts payments
    User->>PC: Click "Sort by Amount"
    PC->>PC: Sort local data
    PC-->>User: Show sorted results

    Note over PC: User navigates pages
    User->>PC: Click "Next Page"
    PC->>PC: Update pagination state
    PC-->>User: Show next page

    Note over PC: User copies payment hash
    User->>PC: Click Copy button
    PC->>CB: writeText(paymentHash)
    CB-->>PC: Success
    PC-->>User: Show toast notification

    Note over PC: User downloads receipt
    User->>PC: Click Download button
    PC->>PC: Generate receipt JSON
    PC->>User: Trigger file download
